273
00:14:17,232 --> 00:14:19,359
And we're back to the photo.

274
00:14:23,947 --> 00:14:26,824
Sampson was documenting
the training for Washington.

275
00:14:30,996 --> 00:14:33,247
<i>I guess we'd gotten careless,</i>

276
00:14:33,248 --> 00:14:37,084
